### GET request to example server
GET http://localhost:8081/authors

### GET user id
GET http://localhost:8081/authors/1

### POST to create author
POST http://localhost:8081/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Joël Dicker",
  "birthdate": "1985-06-16",
  "country": "Suisse"
}

### DELETE a author
DELETE http://localhost:8081/authors/1